Descriptor AchievementCategory
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the category of achievement attributed to the learner.
    with optional map type
        item Competency Mastered
        item Competency Retained
        item Course Completed
        item Level Completed
        item Certificate Earned
        item Diploma Earned
        item License Earned
        item License Endorsement Earned
        item Participation
        item Academic Honor
        item Non-Academic Honor
        item Recognition